        "title": "Weston output management enhancements",
        "short_description": "Making   Weston   able   to   start   without   any   outputs   present   and   survive   when   all   outputs   have   been  disconnected.  ...",
        "description": "<ul>\n<li>Making   Weston   able   to   start   without   any   outputs   present   and   survive   when   all   outputs   have   been  disconnected.  </li>\n<li>Implementing   output   layout   configuration,   so   Weston   can   support   extended   screens.  </li>\n<li>Writing   some   automatic   tests   so   they   can   ensure   that   implemented   features   mentioned   above  won’t get broken during future development.</li>\n</ul>\n",
